      "content": "idk if talking helps. like, i hear people say \"it gets better\" but everything just gets heavier. the bank calls, my boss expects more, and i'm just stuck in this loop. it feels like the more i try to fix things, the more they break. it's just... it's constant. it feels like a trap i can't climb out of no matter what i do.",
